# Tabs - chrome (actions/chrome/chrome_tabs.kbd)
**tabs + l**        -- Tabs Next (C-tab)
**tabs + h**        -- Tabs Prev (C-S-tab)
**tabs + t**        -- Tabs New (C-t)
**tabs + w**        -- Tabs Close (C-w)
**tabs + lsft + t** -- Tabs Undo Close (C-S-t)
**tabs + 1**        -- Tabs Goto 1 (C-1)
**tabs + 2**        -- Tabs Goto 2 (C-2)
**tabs + 3**        -- Tabs Goto 3 (C-3)
**tabs + 4**        -- Tabs Goto 4 (C-4)
**tabs + 5**        -- Tabs Goto 5 (C-5)
**tabs + 6**        -- Tabs Goto 6 (C-6)
**tabs + 7**        -- Tabs Goto 7 (C-7)
**tabs + 8**        -- Tabs Goto 8 (C-8)
**tabs + 9**        -- Tabs Goto 9 (C-9)
**tabs + toggle**   -- Tabs Toggle (A-w)
**tabs + move + h** -- Tabs Move Left (A-S-left)
**tabs + move + l** -- Tabs Move Right (A-S-right)
**tabs + move + j** -- Tabs Move First (A-S-down)
**tabs + move + k** -- Tabs Move Last (A-S-up)
